# A flat front launched by kicking a whole column travels like a pulse in a chain. One pillar just behind the kicked column fires twice.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Strip 3 wide and 10 long kicked across one end
grid 10 3 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 11 amplitude=2
kick 21 amplitude=2
run 1200
expect total 31
expect last 187.24420 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 13.32608 0.003
expect peak 1 53.137531 2e-4
expect count 11 1
expect arrival 11 12.24817 0.003
expect peak 11 58.352540 2e-4
expect count 5 1
expect arrival 5 92.46571 0.003
expect peak 5 58.874716 2e-4
expect count 15 1
expect arrival 15 84.93301 0.003
expect peak 15 56.678752 2e-4
expect count 10 1
expect arrival 10 187.24420 0.003
expect peak 10 53.703781 2e-4
expect count 20 1
expect arrival 20 181.40522 0.003
expect peak 20 59.755562 2e-4
expect count 30 1
expect arrival 30 187.24420 0.003
expect peak 30 53.703781 2e-4
expect each 1 11 1
expect count 12 2
expect each 13 30 1
expect together 10 30 1e-6
